                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "备注"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hardbreak"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "  若没传递targetNodeId，则获取当前节点未操作者（可能有多个，全部返回）；"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "  若传递了targetNodeId，且targetNodeId为当前节点，则获取指定节点未操作者；"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "  若传递了targetNodeId，且targetNodeId不为当前节点，若指定节点为发起节点，则获取指定节点最新轮次操作者；"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "  若传递了targetNodeId，且targetNodeId不为当前节点和发起节点，且calculateConfigOperator=true，则获取指定节点操作组配置的操作者；"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "  若传递了targetNodeId，且targetNodeId不为当前节点和发起节点，且calculateConfigOperator=false，则获取指定节点最新轮次操作者；"
                }
              ]
            }
